        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Ahazini hayyu tahe, ganni isaa diddama, duuba inni ganna kud'ani jaa Yerusalemu keesa lafa mohate. Inni faana ababo isa Daudi gula bahu dide, faana hayyoota Israeli gula bahe, waan AABBO Waaqa ingammachiimne tolche. Inni akheekha waaqa d'ara, ka Baali jed'ani, sibiilani mid'aase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1+2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1",
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bale Hinomu keesati hit'aana aarse, ilma ufile gube, waaqa d'araati sorio baase, akasiini aada hamtu worri duri AABBO Waaqi worra Israeli duraa gusse tolfate gula bahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fulla waaqa d'ara iti kad'atanifi gaareeni gubbafi mukeeni gaadisaa gugurdo jalaleeti, Ahazini sorio baase hit'aana aarse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri Israelitiifi ka Shamu woli had'e",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
