          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Hay 16.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 7.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan hayyu Ahazini waan hamtu suni taheefi, AABBO Waaqi isa harka hayyu Shamuti isa kenne. Hayyuuni sunini isa dabsate nama Yuda heddu boojie dira Damaskiti galche. AABBO Waaqi hayyu Israeli, ka Peka ilma Remalia jed'ani, Ahazi dabsachiise, duuba inni guyya toko keesa askarti Yuda jajanna nama kuma d'ibbafi diddama fit'e. Wonti AABBO Waaqi nyaapa suni worra Yudati lakiseefi waan worri isa dide Baali gula baheefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5+2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5",
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi Zikiri jed'ani, janni toko, ka gosa Efraimu, Maaseya ilma Ahazitifi Azrikamu ka gudda huji mana hayyutifi Elkana ka hayyuuti aanu fit'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli nad'eenifi ijoolle worra Yuda, ka oboleyaani isaani, nama kuma d'ibba lama boojie, ammalle waan heddu d'ibile ch'ufa boojie Samariatini galate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Raaga Odedi jed'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba raaga AABBO Waaqa tokoti jira, ka Odedi jed'ani, ka worri isaa Samaria. Inni duula Israeli ka Samariati galu jiru fuula keesa d'ufe waan jed'eeni, AABBO, Waaqi ababoota teesani, ya worra Yudati dallane worra harka keesaniti kenne, ammo amma tana inni aka isani worra qaqaltani suni layu d'agaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma isani nama Yerusalemutifi ka Yuda, d'iirafi nad'eenile, tisse tolfachu feetani. Isanileeni aka AABBO Waaqa keesani durati ch'ubbu tolchitani ufi ingartani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma dubbi tiyya tana ch'aqasa! Worri isani boojitani kunini oboleyaani teesani. Worra galakisa, yokhaani AABBO Waaqi isaniti dallane isani balleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaaroleeni Efraimu nami afuri, Azaria ilma Yehohananitifi Berekia ilma Meshilemothitifi Yehizkia ilma Shalumutifi Amasa ilmi Hadlaileni waan askartini suni tate didani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'ani, Worra boojitani kana dira kanani ind'ufina! Nu qara AABBO Waaqati ch'ubbamne isa dallansiifne. Isani amma haga qarale ch'ubbu nuti dartani baddi nutiini d'ufu feetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba askartini taani nama boojiteefi waan worraa ka guurate kaani ch'ufa, jaaroleefi gumi gosa isaaniti kennite, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jaaroleeni taani afraani worra boojiani suni ch'ufa, ka qulla yau, miha boojiani kaani keesa woya iti qoode, kobe iti nat'e, waan worri nyaate d'ugu kenniteefi, mada worrale d'ad'a ibsiiteefi. Worra yau indandeennele ch'ufa harre ira naqani, akasiini worra boojiani suni ch'ufa Yeriko, dira meet'i, ka lafa Yudati, galchani. Duuba worri Israeli kaani kae, Samariati deebie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Ahazini worra Ashuru qarqaarsa kad'ate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gosa Edomu ammalle worra Yuda had'e nama heddu boojie, tanaafi hayyu Ahazini hayyu Ashuru ka Tiglath-Pilezeri jed'ani qarqaarsa kad'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16+2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16",
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi worri gosa Filisti dira golba gaareeni ilaadu jirufi ammalle dira Yuda bita jiru had'u jira. Worri dira Beth-Shemeshifa, Ayaloni fa, Gerothifa, Soko fa, Timna fa, Gimzo fa, ollowaani dira suni woliini, dabsate qabe, dira suni keesa qubate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Ahazini hayyuuni Yuda waan hamtu lafa keesati tahe AABBO Waaqa dideefi, AABBO Waaqi worra Yuda gaargala itiini d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Ashuru fulla sila Ahazi qarqaaru, qarqaarsa lakise gaargala itiini d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Ahazini worqi Mana Waaqatifi mana hayyutifi mana jaarole lafa suni keesaa guure, hayyicha Ashuruti kenne, ammo tunileeni isa inqarqaare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ch'ubbu Ahazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaargali iti guddannaani hayyichi Ahazi jed'ani kaani haga qarale ira AABBO Waaqa durati ch'ubbu tolche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni sorio Waaqa Damaskiti baase, ka ufiftu isa dabsate. Duuba waan jed'e, Waaqi Ashuru hayyoota Ashuru qarqaare, tanaafi yo anini sorio baasufi waaqi suni hegeri na qarqaara. Wonti kunini isaafi gosa isaa badi itiini d'ufte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni miha Mana Waaqa ch'ufa guure ch'ach'abse, Mana Waaqa ch'ufe, Yerusalemu keesa moga ch'ufa waan sorio irati qalani mid'aafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira Yuda ch'ufa keesati inni fulla waaqa d'ara iti kad'atani hit'aana aarsanifi jaare. Duuba akanaani AABBO Waaqa ababoota isaa, dallansiise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan inni tolche ch'ufa, haguma geetunu, kitaaba Odu Hayyoota Yudatifi ta Israeli keesati t'aafaniti t'aafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
